<% content_for :title, "Support · Sofenx AI Store Auditor" %>
<main class="legal-shell">
  <p class="eyebrow">Sofenx AI Store Auditor</p>
  <h1>Support</h1>
  <p>Contact <a href="mailto:support@sofenx.com">support@sofenx.com</a>. We normally respond within two business days.</p>
  <nav class="legal-nav"><%= link_to "Privacy", privacy_path %><%= link_to "Terms", terms_path %><%= link_to "Support", support_path %></nav>
  <h2>Support hours</h2>
  <p>Monday through Friday, 9:00 AM–5:00 PM Bangladesh Standard Time (UTC+6), excluding public holidays. Production outages and security reports are prioritized.</p>
  <h2>When reporting an audit problem</h2>
  <p>Include the store domain, audit time, affected finding title, and what the storefront showed. Never send customer data, access tokens, passwords, or API keys.</p>
  <h2>Billing help</h2>
  <p>You can upgrade, change paid plans, or downgrade to Free from the app’s Plans page. Shopify displays and processes every paid charge. If a Shopify charge does not match the plan shown in the app, include the charge date and plan name in your message—never send payment credentials.</p>
  <h2>Privacy and security</h2>
  <p>Use the same email address for privacy requests or responsible security reports. Put “Privacy request” or “Security report” in the subject so we can route it promptly.</p>
  <h2>Business address</h2>
  <p>Sofenx, House 12, Road 16, Sector 11, Uttara, Dhaka, Bangladesh.</p>
</main>
